  <div class="agg-intro-content">
    <span class="agg-intro-label">The Foundation</span>
    <h2 class="agg-intro-title">What are Gemstones in Vedic Astrology?</h2>
    <p class="agg-intro-text">In Vedic astrology (Jyotish), gemstones are not mere ornaments — they are powerful conductors of planetary energy. Each of the nine planets (Navagrahas) corresponds to a specific gemstone that amplifies or harmonises that planet's energy within you.</p>
    <p class="agg-intro-text">When worn correctly — the right stone, the right metal, the right finger, on the right day — a gemstone acts as an antenna that strengthens the positive influence of its ruling planet in your birth chart (Kundali).</p>
    <p class="agg-intro-text">This is not superstition. Vedic texts including Brihat Parashara Hora Shastra and Ratna Pariksha describe the therapeutic and astrological properties of gemstones with precise scientific logic — a logic that has been validated by thousands of years of practice.</p>
  </div>
</div>

{%- comment -%} HOW GEMSTONES WORK {%- endcomment -%}
