      <span class="agg-sec-label">The Science</span>
      <div class="agg-sec-title">How Gemstones Work</div>
      <div class="agg-sec-sub">A blend of ancient wisdom and vibrational science</div>
    </div>
    <div class="agg-how-grid">
      <div class="agg-how-card">
        <div class="agg-how-icon">&#9889;</div>
        <div class="agg-how-title">Vibrational Energy</div>
        <div class="agg-how-text">Every gemstone has a unique crystalline structure that vibrates at a specific frequency. These vibrations resonate with planetary energies and influence the aura and chakra system of the wearer.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-how-card">
        <div class="agg-how-icon">&#127759;</div>
        <div class="agg-how-title">Planetary Conductors</div>
        <div class="agg-how-text">Each planet emits a specific colour frequency of light. Gemstones act as filters and amplifiers of this light — concentrating the beneficial rays of the ruling planet and directing them into the wearer's body.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-how-card">
        <div class="agg-how-icon">&#128313;</div>
        <div class="agg-how-title">Kundali Alignment</div>
        <div class="agg-how-text">Based on your birth chart, certain planets are weak or afflicted. The correct gemstone strengthens that planet's energy, creating a harmonious balance that positively influences the areas of life that planet governs.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{%- comment -%} PLANET → GEMSTONE TABLE {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="agg-planets">
  <div class="agg-planets-inner">
    <div class="agg-planets-hdr">
      <span class="agg-planets-hdr-label">Navagrahas</span>
      <div class="agg-planets-hdr-title">Planet → Gemstone Guide</div>
    </div>
    <div class="agg-planets-grid">
