{%- comment -%} HOW TO CHOOSE / RECOMMENDATION GUIDE {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="agg-guide">
  <div class="agg-guide-inner">
    <div class="agg-guide-hdr">
      <span class="agg-sec-label">Step by Step</span>
      <div class="agg-sec-title">How to Choose Your Gemstone</div>
      <div class="agg-sec-sub">Follow this guide to select the right gemstone for your birth chart</div>
    </div>
    <div class="agg-guide-steps">
      <div class="agg-guide-step">
        <div class="agg-guide-num">1</div>
        <div>
          <div class="agg-guide-title">Get Your Kundali (Birth Chart)</div>
          <div class="agg-guide-text">Your birth chart is the foundation. You need your exact date, time and place of birth to generate an accurate Kundali. The positions of planets at the time of your birth determine which gemstones can benefit you.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-guide-step">
        <div class="agg-guide-num">2</div>
        <div>
          <div class="agg-guide-title">Identify Weak or Beneficial Planets</div>
          <div class="agg-guide-text">A qualified Vedic astrologer will identify which planets in your chart are weak (debilitated, in enemy signs, or aspected negatively) and which would benefit you most if strengthened.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-guide-step">
        <div class="agg-guide-num">3</div>
        <div>
          <div class="agg-guide-title">Select the Corresponding Gemstone</div>
          <div class="agg-guide-text">Based on the planet identified, select the primary gemstone. Always choose a natural, untreated stone with a lab certificate. Weight (ratti/carats) should be at least 1 ratti per 10 kg of body weight.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-guide-step">
        <div class="agg-guide-num">4</div>
        <div>
          <div class="agg-guide-title">Choose the Right Metal and Setting</div>
          <div class="agg-guide-text">The setting metal matters. Gold amplifies Sun, Jupiter and Mars stones. Silver works for Moon, Venus and Saturn stones. The stone should touch the skin — so an open-back setting is ideal.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-guide-step">
        <div class="agg-guide-num">5</div>
        <div>
          <div class="agg-guide-title">Energize Before First Wear</div>
          <div class="agg-guide-text">Before wearing, perform the energization (prana pratishtha) ritual on the correct day of the week associated with the ruling planet. Chant the beej mantra 108 times to activate the stone's energy.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="agg-guide-step">
        <div class="agg-guide-num">6</div>
        <div>
          <div class="agg-guide-title">Observe and Monitor</div>
          <div class="agg-guide-text">After wearing, observe the effects over 40–90 days. If you experience positive changes in the relevant area of life, the gemstone is working. If negative effects occur, consult your astrologer immediately.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

